/-
  OIBridge/ImplementationLocality.lean — the primitive-source audit, second target: the
  source of observational independence.

  ROUND FIFTY-SEVEN. After round fifty-six the carrier-general quantum-complete package is
  composite operational validity, observational independence, reversible richness and
  embedded observation. This file asks where observational independence comes from, in the
  order the audit demands: first whether it is already forced by the other three; then, since
  it is not, what deeper principle supplies it.

  A. THE REDUNDANCY TEST FAILS. The round-34 countermodel (`countermodel`: Kraus families on
  the qubit, 2-positive trace-preserving instruments on every composite) carries the OI
  core, composite operational validity and reversible richness, and it carries EMBEDDED
  OBSERVATION: the 2-positive-instrument theory on every finite carrier (`twoPosTheory`,
  `twoPosFamily`) is a regrouping- and relabelling-invariant family whose qubit member is
  the countermodel on the composites and, by `twoPositive_qubit_cp`, on the system. And it
  has no observational independence (`countermodel_not_inert`). So
  `redundancy_fails`: validity + reversible richness + embedded observation do not imply
  observational independence, and the four-part package does not compress to three.

  B/C. FORM WITHOUT EXISTENCE. Round thirty-seven proved that locality fixes the form of a
  spectator extension uniquely (`isSpectatorExtension_iff`: any extension of `Φ` along `e`
  is `withSpectator R e Φ`), and the countermodel shows that the form being fixed does not
  make the extension available: `form_fixed_existence_fails` records, for the available
  two-qubit reduction map, that its qutrit spectator extension is uniquely determined and
  not available. The missing physics is existence, not form.

  D. THE PRIMITIVE, BELOW AVAILABILITY. An IMPLEMENTATION CLASS `𝓘` says, at every finite
  carrier, which single operators are admissible physical implementations
  (`ImplementationClass`). An operation is REALIZED by the class when it is a finite sum of
  conjugations by admissible operators (`Realized`). Then

      (G) IMPLEMENTATION GENERATION — at every positive level, a family is available exactly
          when each branch is realized by the class and the aggregate trace is preserved
          (`ImplementationGenerated`);
      (C) CONTEXT STABILITY — adjoining dynamically uncoupled degrees of freedom leaves an
          admissible implementation admissible and unchanged on its original support:
          `𝓘 S K → 𝓘 (R × S) (1_R ⊗ K)` (`ContextStable`);
      (L) LABEL INVARIANCE — admissibility is transported along carrier bijections
          (`LabelInvariant`).

  `ImplementationLocality T` is the existence of such a class. Neither (C) nor (L) mentions
  availability, `withSpectator`, `HasParallelReferenceExtension` or
  `InertSpectatorCompositionality`; (G) mentions availability only to say that it is
  generated by implementations.

  E. THE DERIVATION. The spectator extension of a realized operation is realized
  (`realized_withSpectator`): the extension of a conjugation is the conjugation by the
  reindexed `1 ⊗ K` (round thirty-seven's `withSpectator_conjChannel`, the local form), and
  (C), (L) keep that operator admissible. The aggregate trace is preserved by the extension.
  Hence `observationalIndependence_of_implementationLocality`. Validity is derived as well
  (`validity_of_implementationLocality`): realized operations are completely positive.

  F. NECESSITY. Exact finite operational QM is implementation-local with every operator
  admissible (`implementationLocality_of_qm`).

  THE DIAGNOSIS. The countermodel is not implementation-generated by ANY class
  (`countermodel_not_implementationGenerated`): its available reduction map is not
  completely positive, so no finite physical implementation realizes it. Its failure is
  implementability, not context stability. `implementationLocality_independent` records that
  the core, validity, reversible richness and embedded observation do not supply
  implementation locality.

  THE COMPRESSED SET. `OIPlusLocal` is implementation locality, reversible richness and
  embedded observation; `carrier_general_oiPlusLocal` proves it equivalent to exact finite
  endomorphic operational QM on every nonempty finite carrier. Validity is absent because it
  is derived; the normalization half of validity is carried by the trace clause of (G), and
  that is said plainly rather than hidden.

  WHAT IS NOT CLAIMED. Whether context stability is redundant given implementation
  generation (a theory generated by a class not closed under `1 ⊗ ·` and failing
  observational independence) is not settled here. The converse from observational
  independence to implementation locality is not claimed outside the OI⁺ context. Nothing
  here bears on the sources of either clause of reversible richness.
-/

